1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:03,080
Papa.

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:04,790
Whoa!

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Did she just smack her own alley?

4
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,940
So was it you?

5
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:14,080
The one who burned Okoboday Town?

6
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,200
Hey! Huh?

7
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,440
You're dead!

8
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:22,520
I'm gonna squash you ever,
ever so flat, Big Mom!

9
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:27,677
Nobody hurts my Papa! Uh-oh! Wait!

10
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:30,580
Maybe we can have Big
Mom beat up Ulti, too!

11
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:36,140
You know, I thought Big Mom was a
demon, but maybe she's really a goddess.

12
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,650
Hey!

13
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:39,820
Boleyn, listen!

14
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:43,460
That lady is seriously bad!

15
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:46,974
She's the one who did the
awful thing that made you sad!

16
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,897
Whatever that is...

17
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,180
Oh, shut up!

18
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:51,597
You think I'm dumb?

19
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:52,974
You're still my enemy!

20
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:56,120
When I'm done with
Trampasaurus, you're next!

21
00:00:58,740 --> 00:00:59,570
Hurrah!

22
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:02,160
Go, Ulti! You got this!

23
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:05,880
Let's avenge Papa together! Oh, shut up!

24
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:07,077
You think I'm dumb?

25
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:09,572
When I'm done with that hag, you're next!

26
00:01:12,860 --> 00:01:14,331
Komachiyo, let's book it!

27
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:17,220
Go and don't look back!

28
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:19,340
Huh? Hey!

29
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:21,690
Stay there!

30
00:01:21,860 --> 00:01:23,460
I still need to smash you!

31
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:26,970
Ulti!

32
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:28,590
Spider!

33
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,510
Komachiyo!

34
00:01:44,593 --> 00:01:45,499
I'm coming, buddy!

35
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:50,080
I'm ever, ever so sick of
chasing you little dirtbags.

36
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:55,577
And that goes for your big weird dog, too.

37
00:01:55,660 --> 00:01:58,140
I hope that headbutt broke some bones.

38
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:00,380
A whole bunch of them.

39
00:02:04,300 --> 00:02:05,640
Stay away!

40
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:10,340
Look at the poor little
puppy, all beat up.

41
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:14,820
That's what you get for being naughty!

42
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:18,060
Now, play dead!

43
00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:23,180
Damn it!

44
00:02:26,540 --> 00:02:28,360
Stop it, you big man!

45
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:31,470
Tama!

46
00:02:31,553 --> 00:02:32,940
He's my best friend!

47
00:02:33,220 --> 00:02:34,749
He died, you had his idea!

48
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:39,720
Shut up, rat!

49
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,110
Tama!

50
00:02:42,460 --> 00:02:43,290
Otama!

51
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:44,630
Are you okay?

52
00:02:47,340 --> 00:02:48,760
Come on, let's go!

53
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,500
Carry her and run, Nami!

54
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:52,940
We're all gonna die! Hey!

55
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:54,790
Bitch!

56
00:02:55,220 --> 00:02:56,050
Huh?

57
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:59,660
How dare you lay a hand
on my little friend! Ugh!

58
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:03,200
How dare you lay a hand
on my little brother!

59
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,880
You filthy lizard!

60
00:03:05,260 --> 00:03:07,680
How could you do that to a mother?!

61
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:15,980
Nami, stop it!

62
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,320
We gotta go!

63
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:18,680
I'm sorry!

64
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,260
Not this time!

65
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:21,397
I can't!

66
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:24,420
Not when she hit a child?

67
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,400
This is personal!

68
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:38,840
I'll kick her ass myself!

69
00:04:02,740 --> 00:04:08,140
I don't know.

70
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:55,680
Onore-ro-jitsu-wo-e-gai-desu-te

71
00:05:22,180 --> 00:05:24,200
Aye, that's Black-Legged Surge!

72
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:26,940
He's got a bounty of 330 million berries!

73
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:28,480
How tough can he be?

74
00:05:35,300 --> 00:05:37,580
Hey, who's that dude he's carrying?

75
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,294
It's gotta be the Pirate Hunter Sorrel!

76
00:05:40,580 --> 00:05:42,460
They're crewmates! What?

77
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:45,860
That's Big Money carrying bigger money!

78
00:05:46,300 --> 00:05:47,940
Hey, watch what you say!

79
00:05:49,100 --> 00:05:52,500
Sorry big money is carrying
slightly less big money.

80
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,957
That's not the issue.

81
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,820
Oh Am I too noisy?

82
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,400
So sorry.

83
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,430
Hey!

84
00:06:01,513 --> 00:06:02,540
Oh!

85
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:07,877
Well, well captain kid captain kid?

86
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:13,440
Wait, sorry, but you're not getting
through glad you guys showed up.

87
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,940
I need some more scrap

88
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:28,400
You, on the other hand, I don't need you!

89
00:06:35,140 --> 00:06:36,460
Suck on this!

90
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:37,660
You're done!

91
00:06:46,660 --> 00:06:49,920
Big Mom, where are you?

92
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:55,260
Good luck, I guess. Damn it.

93
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:58,457
That must have swapped us
with something in the air.

94
00:06:58,540 --> 00:06:59,370
Huh?

95
00:06:59,453 --> 00:07:00,283
Blackleg?

96
00:07:00,366 --> 00:07:02,440
Is that Traffy and Mosshead?

97
00:07:02,860 --> 00:07:04,340
Don't let us fall!

98
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,837
I thought you were on the roof.

99
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,920
Why are you here?

100
00:07:12,860 --> 00:07:14,300
Where the heck am I?

101
00:07:14,460 --> 00:07:15,780
And where did Mama go?

102
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,940
I'm coming, Mama, I promise!

103
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:20,270
Zeus!

104
00:07:20,353 --> 00:07:21,183
What are you doing?

105
00:07:21,266 --> 00:07:22,096
Where's Nami?

106
00:07:22,460 --> 00:07:24,754
I thought you were working for her now.

107
00:07:26,140 --> 00:07:28,420
Hey, come back here! Leave him be.

108
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:30,837
Why the hell are you still sitting on me?

109
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:33,214
This space is reserved for ladies only!

110
00:07:33,420 --> 00:07:34,717
I'm glad we ended up here.

111
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,630
We could use the help.

112
00:07:35,713 --> 00:07:36,960
Oh, yeah, sure.

113
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:39,537
Just pop out of nowhere
and give me orders.

114
00:07:39,620 --> 00:07:40,777
Just take care of him.

115
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:41,690
He's injured.

116
00:07:44,220 --> 00:07:45,460
What happened to him?

117
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:49,270
Hey, wait!

118
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:51,817
Can't you at least explain
the situation first?

119
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:53,253
He's in real bad shape.

120
00:07:53,620 --> 00:07:55,600
Probably broke 20 or 30 bones.

121
00:07:56,020 --> 00:07:58,197
Splint up his body, put him on his back.

122
00:07:58,280 --> 00:07:59,977
Make sure he's conscious and breathing.

123
00:08:00,060 --> 00:08:02,797
I'm worried about the battle,
not this idiot's health!

124
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:03,980
You're the doctor!

125
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:05,977
Why the hell don't you take care of him?

126
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:08,337
I would, but I need to shut down Big Mom.

127
00:08:08,420 --> 00:08:09,977
You can do first aid at least.

128
00:08:10,060 --> 00:08:11,077
What am I supposed to do?

129
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,357
Just don't let him die!

130
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:13,270
Hey!

131
00:08:13,353 --> 00:08:14,620
Don't walk away from me!

132
00:08:14,860 --> 00:08:17,280
I told you I'm not the doctor here!

133
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:28,828
You don't know how to
apply bandage, do you?

134
00:08:30,060 --> 00:08:33,413
I've trussed a ham before,
it's basically the same thing.

135
00:08:33,940 --> 00:08:35,740
So I'm a ham to you.

136
00:08:36,180 --> 00:08:38,960
No way you taste that good. Never mind.

137
00:08:41,060 --> 00:08:41,890
Anyway.

138
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:53,360
So, uh, who managed to hurt you this bad?

139
00:08:53,820 --> 00:08:55,580
Kaido and Big Mom together.

140
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:56,920
No wonder.

141
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:59,440
Well, at least you found the roof.

142
00:09:00,180 --> 00:09:02,709
I take it Luffy's in
better shape than you.

143
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:05,397
It's been rough, but I think
he figured something out.

144
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,800
He's gonna win this.

145
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:10,104
You don't have to tell me that.

146
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:14,260
What a mess!

147
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:19,761
I'd stuff your ass in a
closet if I had it my way!

148
00:09:23,740 --> 00:09:24,620
Sir Sangoro!

149
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:26,290
Uh, Kappa.

150
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,539
Glad to see you guys are all right.

151
00:09:32,020 --> 00:09:33,980
Uh, hey, Nami.

152
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:37,157
I get that you're angry, but
we gotta run away, quick!

153
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,737
She won't be out for long!

154
00:09:38,820 --> 00:09:41,617
You saw how many times her
brother came back to get us!

155
00:09:41,700 --> 00:09:43,520
Also, Big Mom is right there!

156
00:09:43,700 --> 00:09:46,229
No matter how you look
at it, we can't win!

157
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:50,497
Even if we run, Ulti won't stop chasing
us until we take her out for good!

158
00:09:50,580 --> 00:09:55,060
But more than that, I'm not letting
her go after what she did to Otama.

159
00:09:56,420 --> 00:09:57,600
Come on, Otama.

160
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,680
Hang in there.

161
00:09:59,860 --> 00:10:01,660
Otama, tell me you're okay.

162
00:10:04,140 --> 00:10:05,920
I know you're not dead.

163
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,400
Get up already.

164
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:16,000
Just can't wait for me to bust your
head open like a big ripe melon.

165
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:22,800
Oh, you see that, boys?

166
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:24,520
She's got a baton!

167
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:28,720
This cheerleader thinks she can
take out Lady Ulti on her own!

168
00:10:30,260 --> 00:10:31,090
Tornado!

169
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:33,730
Tickle!

170
00:10:38,300 --> 00:10:41,560
That was a nice surprise
attack, but it's not enough!

171
00:10:41,940 --> 00:10:42,940
You done yet?

172
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:47,980
Time to die.

173
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:55,380
Oh you want some too?

174
00:10:55,660 --> 00:10:57,560
Don't worry weird little man.

175
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:59,940
Once I'm done with her you are next.

176
00:11:07,060 --> 00:11:10,480
I've hated your guts from
the first moment we met.

177
00:11:11,820 --> 00:11:16,037
Not only do you scurry away
like a rat every chance you get,

178
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:20,700
You also said your crappy little captain
was gonna be king of the pirates,

179
00:11:21,060 --> 00:11:23,020
but no big deal, right?

180
00:11:23,540 --> 00:11:27,540
It'll all be worth it once I
finally smash your skull in!

181
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:29,730
Palti!

182
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:38,460
Oh, Nami, please don't die.

183
00:11:39,980 --> 00:11:42,460
Yes, Mama! Yes, Mama!

184
00:11:44,100 --> 00:11:46,140
Yes, Mama! Yes, Mama!

185
00:11:48,460 --> 00:11:49,290
Let's go!

186
00:12:02,340 --> 00:12:03,700
Come on!

187
00:12:08,460 --> 00:12:11,000
Mesa-chanal!

188
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:46,700
She took out Lady Ulti in one shot.

189
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:50,139
And she took out her brother
just a second ago, too.

190
00:12:52,020 --> 00:12:54,540
Whose side is she supposed to be on?

191
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:56,920
Nami, can you stand?

192
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:59,097
That was crazy, but she's finished.

193
00:12:59,180 --> 00:13:01,120
Let's run away. Right.

194
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:02,740
Call Mathieu.

195
00:13:03,380 --> 00:13:05,540
We can't save him now. I'm sorry.

196
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:06,837
We'll come back later.

197
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:07,750
I promise.

198
00:13:13,020 --> 00:13:13,900
Huh? Zeus?

199
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:18,560
If he's there, who's that other cloud?

200
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,670
Wow!

201
00:13:21,753 --> 00:13:23,595
We really hit it off, didn't we, Hera?

202
00:13:24,580 --> 00:13:28,577
I could never pull off such an awesome
combo attack with stupid old Zeus.

203
00:13:28,660 --> 00:13:31,917
We made a pretty amazing team,
too, wouldn't you say, Hera?

204
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:34,957
You sad little simpletons are
getting ahead of yourselves.

205
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:36,877
All I did was follow Mama's lead.

206
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:39,320
Look at you teasing me. Aww.

207
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:42,257
I'm so glad I asked Mama
to make me a girlfriend.

208
00:13:42,340 --> 00:13:44,752
And now here you are in the cloudy flesh.

209
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:45,960
Your girlfriend?

210
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:47,800
No, thank you. What?

211
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:49,280
That's okay.

212
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:51,402
I like my ladies a little fiery.

213
00:13:52,820 --> 00:13:56,140
And either way, it's nice
to have a girl in the group.

214
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:00,150
Prometheus?

215
00:14:00,780 --> 00:14:01,840
I agree.

216
00:14:02,180 --> 00:14:05,356
So let's work together to
be Mama's best helpers ever.

217
00:14:06,140 --> 00:14:06,970
Napoleon?

218
00:14:07,380 --> 00:14:09,457
Glad I threw Zeus out with the trash.

219
00:14:09,540 --> 00:14:12,220
Seems you three will
make a much better team.

220
00:14:12,500 --> 00:14:13,900
This is messed up.

221
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:16,180
Who is that girl? Indeed.

222
00:14:16,640 --> 00:14:19,111
Zeus set a good example of what not to do.

223
00:14:21,060 --> 00:14:21,997
She's mean.

224
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:24,337
Why is she taking my place?

225
00:14:24,420 --> 00:14:28,460
Does this mean I'm gonna
be all alone from now on?

226
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:34,620
It's not me!

227
00:14:43,140 --> 00:14:46,100
You finally turned up. Hey, Mama.

228
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:48,106
I'm sorry I kept you waiting.

229
00:14:49,420 --> 00:14:51,596
Looks like we have a new member, huh?

230
00:14:52,820 --> 00:14:55,820
Well, four's better
than three, I say. Four?

231
00:14:56,580 --> 00:14:58,560
I'm afraid you're mistaken.

232
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:01,980
You've been replaced.

233
00:15:02,500 --> 00:15:04,060
We don't need you.

234
00:15:10,020 --> 00:15:10,850
Remarkable.

235
00:15:10,933 --> 00:15:12,135
Where are you headed?

236
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:13,928
We'll gladly accompany you.

237
00:15:14,380 --> 00:15:17,262
For what it's worth, my
sword is at your service.

238
00:15:18,060 --> 00:15:20,057
What do you mean, where am I headed?

239
00:15:20,140 --> 00:15:21,577
I'm looking for Momonosuke.

240
00:15:21,660 --> 00:15:23,013
I thought you were too.

241
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,717
Kin'emon is going to aid him.

242
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:25,737
He should be fine.

243
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:28,702
If you want to help, go
to the performance floor.

244
00:15:28,940 --> 00:15:30,234
Why would we go there?

245
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:35,140
Don't make a request
and fall asleep, dammit!

246
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:36,800
I see no reason not to go.

247
00:15:37,180 --> 00:15:38,180
Yes, let's hurry.

248
00:15:38,500 --> 00:15:40,500
Any life we can save is a victory.

249
00:15:55,820 --> 00:15:56,650
Thunder!

250
00:15:57,020 --> 00:15:58,140
Wild War!

251
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:10,150
Yeah!

252
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:37,014
You're having fun playing
with your new toy, aren't you?

253
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:44,060
And I'm sure it's even more fun to try
it out on someone stronger than you.

254
00:17:15,140 --> 00:17:18,640
I tore down one wall after another,

255
00:17:19,020 --> 00:17:21,757
laying waste to everyone
who was stronger than me.

256
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:25,577
Until the world had no
choice but to call me the

257
00:17:25,660 --> 00:17:29,080
strongest But what do I
see from these heights?

258
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:34,960
A barren landscape, filled with weak
wings There's nowhere left to climb!

259
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:44,297
You wouldn't understand.

260
00:17:44,380 --> 00:17:48,200
You can smile, because you still
have someone worth fighting!

261
00:17:53,180 --> 00:17:56,897
But you can't win, you're
just indulging in a lie.

262
00:17:56,980 --> 00:18:01,177
This country will bend to my will.

263
00:18:01,260 --> 00:18:03,837
A Kozuki clan will be destroyed.

264
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:08,997
Water will become new Onigashima,
and I'll be bored again.

265
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:11,600
Alone with my strength.

266
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:26,120
The Kozuki clan's not going anywhere!

267
00:18:30,380 --> 00:18:34,420
The land of Wano will be free!

268
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:47,320
And then you'll see!

269
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:53,457
What the hell I'm gonna
be king of the pirates

270
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:59,077
mama could have been killed
while you were snoozing?

271
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:02,417
On the job but they
captured me stop acting like

272
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:04,477
that was the first time
you screwed something up!

273
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:09,680
The good news is it will
be the last time mama Ah!

274
00:19:13,980 --> 00:19:18,040
Hera, how about you eat Zeus for me? What?

275
00:19:18,580 --> 00:19:22,940
By consuming his soul,
you'll become even stronger.

276
00:19:23,460 --> 00:19:25,166
How could you say that, Mama?

277
00:19:25,700 --> 00:19:26,720
I'll die!

278
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:31,586
I'm sure he'll be delectable.

279
00:19:32,300 --> 00:19:33,220
Let's see!

280
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:38,320
What are all those
flavors for me, O 'Kara?

281
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:40,900
Stop her mama!

282
00:19:41,260 --> 00:19:43,420
She keeps this up all the time!

283
00:19:43,700 --> 00:19:46,160
Ah, ma-ma-ma! Ha-ha!

284
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:49,420
I'm so sorry!

285
00:19:49,660 --> 00:19:51,425
I didn't mean to do a bad job!

286
00:19:51,540 --> 00:19:54,481
If you don't want me, then
I promise I'll go away!

287
00:19:54,660 --> 00:19:55,760
Stop swearing!

288
00:19:56,260 --> 00:19:58,420
You're on the fear of my left hand!

289
00:19:58,540 --> 00:20:01,277
I'll never show I think to
you guys again, I swear it!

290
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:03,380
So please, don't do this to me!

291
00:20:04,940 --> 00:20:06,500
I don't wanna die!

292
00:20:07,840 --> 00:20:10,958
I gave you a piece of my
soul and you're running off?

293
00:20:11,260 --> 00:20:14,220
Why should I have mercy on a filthy thief?

294
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:27,480
If you're really sorry, you'll let
her eat you and give your power back.

295
00:20:30,580 --> 00:20:32,700
Anything but that, please.

296
00:20:34,460 --> 00:20:35,940
It's what you deserve.

297
00:20:36,500 --> 00:20:38,400
Right, Otama?

298
00:20:38,620 --> 00:20:39,640
Oh, crap.

299
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:46,280
What the?

300
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:52,200
Let's move you out of the
way while I kill them.

301
00:20:52,500 --> 00:20:54,920
I'll keep you safe. Otama!

302
00:20:58,780 --> 00:20:59,960
You're awake.

303
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:01,780
You had me so worried.

304
00:21:05,180 --> 00:21:07,600
Stay there and don't move, sweetie.

305
00:21:08,340 --> 00:21:10,460
Oh, Nami, there's a hot shake!

306
00:21:10,980 --> 00:21:12,220
Ignore those two.

307
00:21:12,580 --> 00:21:16,620
They're from a very naughty
pirate crew called the Straw Hats.

308
00:21:16,980 --> 00:21:18,640
Not to worry, though.

309
00:21:18,880 --> 00:21:21,480
I'm gonna kill them!

310
00:21:23,700 --> 00:21:25,320
Get back here!

311
00:21:29,100 --> 00:21:30,597
Don't hurt them, Elaine!

312
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:32,080
They're my friends!

313
00:21:32,600 --> 00:21:33,980
They're not bad guys!

314
00:21:34,180 --> 00:21:36,239
They came here to take the country!

315
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:38,140
Mama, Mama!

316
00:21:40,960 --> 00:21:42,280
Someone help!

317
00:21:44,080 --> 00:21:44,910
Nami!

318
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:47,270
Huh?

319
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:49,180
I'm so sorry!

320
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:54,209
I shouldn't have tried
to kill you, I know!

321
00:21:54,380 --> 00:21:56,700
I am really sorry, Nami!

322
00:21:57,340 --> 00:21:59,037
I shouldn't have known you at all!

323
00:21:59,120 --> 00:22:01,440
You pathetic little coward!

324
00:22:01,940 --> 00:22:03,820
I am so over you!

325
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:05,620
I failed you!

326
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:08,437
I couldn't...

327
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:09,840
I know to mama!

328
00:22:11,940 --> 00:22:12,770
Dorry!

329
00:22:13,900 --> 00:22:16,180
I was afraid of what she might do,

330
00:22:16,320 --> 00:22:19,438
so I betrayed you even though
you were so nice to me!

331
00:22:20,140 --> 00:22:24,020
I'm just a useless
coward, but I'm so sorry!

332
00:22:26,240 --> 00:22:27,597
It's too late now!

333
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:31,940
I told you we're done,
didn't I? Come on! I know!

334
00:22:32,340 --> 00:22:35,720
And now, Mama and everybody
else hates me too!

335
00:22:36,440 --> 00:22:38,900
I don't have anyone else to go!

336
00:22:45,360 --> 00:22:46,640
I do!

337
00:22:46,940 --> 00:22:48,822
I'll die just like I deserve to!

338
00:22:49,220 --> 00:22:52,044
But I don't want to die
with everyone hating me!

339
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:54,640
I want you to see this!

340
00:22:54,980 --> 00:22:55,860
That's enough!

341
00:22:57,680 --> 00:23:01,440
But I want to be brave at
least once, before I die!

342
00:23:07,940 --> 00:23:08,770
Tama!

343
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:12,830
Usahachi!

344
00:23:14,120 --> 00:23:14,980
Let's hurry!

345
00:23:16,700 --> 00:23:20,800
You don't have to forgive me, but
I need to make this up to you!

346
00:23:21,220 --> 00:23:22,620
Then I can die!

347
00:23:23,340 --> 00:23:24,170
Nami!

348
00:23:24,300 --> 00:23:25,240
Run away!

349
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:29,220
It's not must throw up
from my life for you!

350
00:23:29,820 --> 00:23:30,650
Zeus, wait!

351
00:23:35,100 --> 00:23:35,930
Zeus?

352
00:23:40,140 --> 00:23:42,040
That's all I've got. Goodbye.

353
00:23:47,280 --> 00:23:48,560
Oh, no.

354
00:23:48,920 --> 00:23:50,520
Is that a soul coming out?

355
00:23:50,760 --> 00:23:51,720
Nice job!

356
00:23:53,280 --> 00:23:54,640
Finish him off!

357
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:00,820
You little idiot!

358
00:24:04,960 --> 00:24:06,960
I'll give you a snack out of pity!

359
00:24:07,500 --> 00:24:09,400
Eat them and run, okay, dude?

360
00:24:11,140 --> 00:24:11,970
Hurry!

361
00:24:13,720 --> 00:24:15,720
She really did take his soul!

362
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:17,977
He's not even going
for his favorite snack!

363
00:24:18,060 --> 00:24:19,620
Eat them! Come on!

364
00:24:20,020 --> 00:24:21,020
Wake up!

365
00:24:21,620 --> 00:24:22,717
Here I go!

366
00:24:22,800 --> 00:24:24,920
It's dinnertime for moi!

367
00:24:28,340 --> 00:24:29,820
Come on!

368
00:24:30,280 --> 00:24:31,160
Fight it!

369
00:24:34,780 --> 00:24:36,600
Such power!

370
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:38,120
Oh my!

371
00:24:42,960 --> 00:24:44,760
She ate him!

372
00:24:47,340 --> 00:24:50,340
Uzuhachi! Onami! Let's hurry!

373
00:24:51,220 --> 00:24:52,050
Otama!

374
00:24:52,133 --> 00:24:53,000
There's no time!

375
00:24:53,760 --> 00:24:54,680
Let's go!

376
00:25:03,580 --> 00:25:06,240
Utama, why are you running away?

377
00:25:09,100 --> 00:25:10,260
I see.

378
00:25:10,740 --> 00:25:12,520
You're leaving me, huh?

379
00:25:13,480 --> 00:25:14,460
Fine, then.

380
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:16,485
Seems you want to be my enemy.

381
00:25:20,660 --> 00:25:21,780
Don't look back!

382
00:25:22,740 --> 00:25:26,180
Once you cross me, there's
only one way it can end.

383
00:25:30,800 --> 00:25:32,620
Mama's gonna kill you!

384
00:25:55,340 --> 00:25:57,060
It's you!

385
00:25:57,620 --> 00:25:59,740
Are you done!

386
00:26:24,100 --> 00:26:25,060
Mama!

387
00:26:25,780 --> 00:26:27,260
What was that?

388
00:26:27,560 --> 00:26:28,501
Are you alright?

389
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:38,360
Kid.

390
00:26:40,140 --> 00:26:43,140
You came to rescue us!

391
00:26:44,120 --> 00:26:47,580
Get over yourselves, I
don't give a crap about you!

392
00:26:48,900 --> 00:26:50,300
Step aside!

393
00:26:51,300 --> 00:26:53,280
Big Bob is mine!

394
00:27:20,460 --> 00:27:21,620
Go ahead.

395
00:27:22,040 --> 00:27:23,320
Keep coming at me.

396
00:27:23,780 --> 00:27:25,800
I'm enjoying this.

397
00:27:40,340 --> 00:27:41,897
That's no good, boy.

398
00:27:41,980 --> 00:27:43,568
Hey, you're getting weaker.

399
00:28:03,980 --> 00:28:06,620
What a shame.

400
00:28:07,180 --> 00:28:08,600
Burned out already.

401
00:28:39,360 --> 00:28:43,640
You came a long way, but it
seems this is as far as you go.

402
00:28:44,380 --> 00:28:45,909
You've reached your limit.

403
00:29:17,140 --> 00:29:19,060
Still grinning, are you?

404
00:29:19,600 --> 00:29:21,500
Come on!

405
00:29:21,820 --> 00:29:24,860
I'll knock you down again and again!

406
00:29:48,020 --> 00:29:51,580
Oh, my God.

407
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:24,137
That's it over in an
instant though I shouldn't

408
00:30:24,220 --> 00:30:27,800
be surprised the outcome
was clear from the start.

409
00:30:29,740 --> 00:30:34,300
You got your hands on a powerful
weapon but it made you cocky.

410
00:30:35,420 --> 00:30:39,277
You didn't think for a moment that
your Haki wouldn't be enough.?

411
00:30:39,360 --> 00:30:41,125
You wouldn't dare to think it.

412
00:30:43,280 --> 00:30:46,200
Because humans can't
stand to give up hope.

413
00:30:46,840 --> 00:30:48,260
They refuse to.

414
00:30:48,820 --> 00:30:50,600
So they believe in lies.

415
00:30:57,780 --> 00:31:01,604
It's been a long time since I got
worked up enough to get sloppy.

416
00:31:02,180 --> 00:31:05,497
I should have chopped your head
off and shown it to your friends.

417
00:31:05,580 --> 00:31:08,800
They have to know you've lost.

418
00:31:14,620 --> 00:31:20,220
Otherwise, they'll keep holding on to
the foolish hope that you'll return.
